{"version":1,"content":"<p>投資者愈發看好在烏克蘭戰場接受過實戰檢驗的自主武器系統，烏克蘭國防科技企業 UFORCE 完成 7 億美元融資，估值達到 60 億美元。UFORCE 研發空中、海上、陸地無人裝備，以及用於協同調度裝備的 AI 軟件。該公司今年 3 月曾完成 5000 萬美元融資，當時估值約 10 億美元。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586078.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T12:23:53.007775+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":150,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T12:14:38+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T12:17:15.033343+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T12:17:15.033343+00:00","content_hash":"59f5cf749a9ef47373e5be7d3812e28dfaeb436950146f7c4666d644efe8fcdc","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}